  "hints": [
    {
      "en": "T_n = a + (n - 1)d. For the sum, pair the first term with the last, the second with the second last, and so on."
    }
  ],
  "explanation": {
    "en": "$a = 5$, $d = 3$, $T_n = 5 + (n-1)3 = 3n + 2$. $T_{10} = 32$, so $S_{10} = \\frac{10}{2}(5 + 32) = 185$."
  },
